==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*pelto}}, a loan from {{etyl|gem-pro|fi}} {{m|gem-pro|*felþuz}} (see English {{term|field|lang=en}}). Cognate with Estonian {{term|põld|lang=et}}, Livonian {{m|liv|põld}}, Veps {{term|pöud|lang=vep}}, Votic {{term|põlto|lang=vot}}.

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# [[field]] (''in farming'')

